gmail.com}]","venue":{"name":"[Oficina do Estudante](http:\/\/www.oficinadoestudante.com.br) Unidade V","address":"Av. Jos\u00e9 Bonif\u00e1cio, 2777 ","details":"Sports gymnasium","coordinates":{"latitude":-22.900733,"longitude":-47.029801}},"information":"# REGISTRO\r\n\r\nA participa\u00e7\u00e3o nessa competi\u00e7\u00e3o requer do competidor o conhecimento dos seguintes requisitos:\r\n\r\n1.\tTomar todos os cuidados referente ao COVID-19 e seguir o que ser\u00e1 indicado pelo delegado e organizador da competi\u00e7\u00e3o;\r\n2.\tConhecer as regras da WCA, pois \u00e9 uma competi\u00e7\u00e3o oficial;\r\n3.\tEscolher os eventos a serem registrados com cuidado ap\u00f3s revisar as guias Eventos e Cronograma. Preste aten\u00e7\u00e3o aos formatos das rodadas e seus cortes\/limites;\r\n4.\tSe inscrever atrav\u00e9s do site da WCA. A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o ter\u00e1 custo de R$ 25,00 (inscri\u00e7\u00e3o+camiseta) pagos antecipadamente por meio de dep\u00f3sito banc\u00e1rio ou pix. N\u00e3o ser\u00e3o aceitas inscri\u00e7\u00f5es no dia do campeonato.\r\nConta para deposito: Banco Itau | Ag. 7021 | CC 05400-7 -> Pix 103552998-01.\r\n5.\tOutras informa\u00e7\u00f5es adicionais verifique no site da WCA ou entre em contato com o organizador atrav\u00e9s do e-mail (antonio.cecchini@gmail.com), bem como o delegado por meio do e-mail (pmiranda@worldcubeassociation.org).\r\n\r\nO acesso ao local ser\u00e1 permitido mediante comprova\u00e7\u00e3o de esquema vacinal completo, ou  teste negativo para Covid-19 do tipo PCR, realizado at\u00e9 48 horas antes do ingresso no local, ou do tipo ant\u00edgeno, realizado at\u00e9 24 horas antes do ingresso no estabelecimento (para o competidor e o acompanhante). Para as crian\u00e7as menores de 12 anos, ser\u00e1 solicitado o teste negativo de Covid-19 do tipo PCR, realizado at\u00e9 48 horas antes do ingresso no estabelecimento, ou do tipo ant\u00edgeno, realizado at\u00e9 24 horas antes do acesso ao local. Essas regras podem ser mais restritas ou flexibilizadas conforme orienta\u00e7\u00f5es dos \u00f3rg\u00e3os governamentais at\u00e9 a data do evento.\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\n**REGISTRATION**\r\n\r\nThe participation in this competition requires the comprehension and acceptance of the following requirements:\r\n\r\n1.\tTake all precautions regarding COVID-19 and follow what will be indicated by the delegate and the organizer;\r\n2.\tBeing familiar with the WCA rules, since this is an official competition;\r\n3.\tCarefully choosing the events. Keep the rounds format, cutoffs and limits in mind.\r\n4.\tRegister through the WCA website.The registration fee is R$25,00 (registration+shirt) paid in advance by bank transfer or Pix. Registration at competition day will not be allowed.\r\nBank Account:  Itau Bank | Ag. 7021 | CC 05400-7 -> Pix 103552998-01.\r\n5.\tFor additional information, check the WCA website or contact the organizer via email, (antonio.cecchini@gmail.com), or the delegate via email  (pmiranda@worldcubeassociation.org).\r\n\r\nAccess to the venue will be allowed upon proof of the complete vaccination schedule, or a negative test for Covid-19 of the PCR type, took up to 48 hours before entering the venue, or of the antigen type, took up to 24 hours before entry into the establishment (for both competitor and companion). For children under 12 years of age, a negative Covid-19 PCR test will be required, took within 48 hours before entering the establishment, or an antigen test took within 24 hours before entering the venue. These rules may be changed to be more restrictive or flexible based upon governmental mandates until the event date.","externalWebsite":null},{"id":"OficinaOpen2023","name":"Oficina Open 2023","city":"Campinas, S\u00e3o Paulo","country":"BR","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["222","333","333bf","333oh","444","555","666","777","clock","minx","pyram","skewb","sq1"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Alexandre de Siqueira