try":"ZA","date":{"from":"2023-06-25 17:38:36","till":"2023-06-25 17:38:36"},"isCanceled":false,"events":["333bf","333fm","333mbf","444bf","555bf"],"wcaDelegate":"[{Brendan James Gray}{mailto:bgray@worldcubeassociation.org}]","organiser":"[{Brendan James Gray}{mailto:bgray@worldcubeassociation.org}]","venue":{"name":"Private residence, Bryanston, Johannesburg","address":"See information section","details":"","coordinates":{"latitude":-26.056912,"longitude":28.02279}},"information":"### This is not a normal competition\r\n\r\nWe won't be holding any normal events. This competition is focused on blindfolded events, with a single fewest move attempt to keep things interesting.\r\n\r\nIf you have not competed before, this may not be the best experience for your first competition. Sign up at [CubingZA](https:\/\/cubingza.org) to get notifications for other competitions in your province.\r\n\r\n**Please be quiet**. These events can require immense focus, so as the name of the competition suggests, competitors and spectators must remain quiet to ensure fair and equal conditions for all competitors. Those who continually make noise will be asked to leave without refund.\r\n\r\n### Venue\r\n\r\nThe venue is in a private venue in Bryanston. Access for all competitors and guests need to be arranged in advance. Failure to do so will result in you or your guests being denied access to the venue.\r\nThere is limited parking that needs to be arranged in advance. **All competitors** must please provide the following information:\r\n\r\n1. If you will be arriving by car, please provide registration number.\r\n2. If you will be getting a lift with someone, please provide the name of the person you will be getting a lift with.\r\n3. If using an Uber or other transport, please indicate this.\r\n\r\nOnce you have provided this information, you will be given the exact address.\r\n\r\n### Guests\r\n\r\nCompetitors may bring only one guest due to venue constraints. If a competitor is bring